WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.501
-Well, guys, it seems like
there's so much

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.734
going on right now.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:04.901
This week, former president
Trump was arrested

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:07.300
and charged here in New York.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.834
Plus --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.868
Plus, Easter is on Sunday.

00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:16.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.467
The new "Super Mario Bros."
movie is now in theaters.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.501
And I just heard the NBA

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:24.033
says it will no longer
test players for weed.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.634
-Ooh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:27.834
-There's a lot to go over,

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.334
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:31.067
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:35.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.501
First up, Trump's arrest.

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:40.601
He's facing 34 charges
related to hush-money payments.

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.801
He's in real trouble, and every
time he opens his mouth

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:45.200
to talk about the case,
his lawyers say...

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.167
Jesus.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.100
That's who Easter's all about.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.200
Families come together
to celebrate.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.367
And of course, on Sunday,

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:55.601
the Easter Bunny
will show up and shout,

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:59.200
"It's a-me."
That's Mario's catchphrase.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.901
And you can hear it in the all
new "Super Mario Bros. Movie."

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:03.534
I hope there's a scene
on Rainbow Road,

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.934
flying down that colorful track
makes you feel...

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:08.133
high as a kite.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.901
That's what you can be
in the NBA

00:01:09.901 --> 00:01:12.701
because they're no longer
testing players for marijuana.

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:14.334
It's crazy to think
a couple years ago

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:15.767
smoking weed
could land you...

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:18.901
in jail.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:21.167
Trump pled not guilty
on Tuesday,

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.934
but as the judge
read the charges,

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:26.133
it became pretty clear that his
best legal defense is to...

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:28.300
pray.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:29.634
I really hope the Easter Bunny
brings me

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:31.534
some Easter chocolate
and marshmallow Peeps.

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:32.601
That would be so...

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.968
dope.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:36.601
Yeah, marijuana
is fair game now.

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:39.467
So after every game, the teams
are gonna head to White...

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:42.367
Castle -- that's where
Peach lives -- in a castle.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.801
This movie can make
175 million bucks

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:45.968
in one weekend.

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:47.267
Wow.
Nobody's made so much money

00:01:47.267 --> 00:01:48.601
in so little time since...

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:51.868
Stormy Daniels.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.868 --> 00:01:54.100
Trump gave her hush money
for their one-night stand,

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.534
but she still told everyone that
his junk looks like...

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:59.300
a mushroom, kind of like Toad,

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.901
who's in the movie,
and so is Yoshi.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:03.467
Maybe we'll see him hatch from
one of his famous green...

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:04.501
eggs.

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:05.901
Kids put them
in their Easter baskets,

00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:07.801
along with candy, presents
and, of course...

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:09.467
grass.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:11.734
In conclusion, karts are driven,

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:14.300
big decision, he is risen.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.767
Have fun in prison.

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:17.901
This has been
a "News Smash."

00:02:17.901 --> 00:02:21.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

